  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2026 WA4605 Connected for Change: Strengthening Civil Society and Youth Advocacy Across Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">If CSOs are provided with the necessary tools, skills, and mentorship to operate transparently and sustainably, and if young people &#x2013; including the most-at-risk and vulnerable adolescents and youth &#x2013; are engaged through rights education and empowering participatory methods, and if advocacy is strengthened through coalitions, innovative youth-led methods, and regional networking, then civil society in Ukraine will become more connected, resilient, and effective in advancing rights. This will enable CSOs to amplify marginalized voices and ensure inclusive recovery and protection of rights.</narrative>
  </description>
